  "text": "### Mortgage Rates (MORT-001)  \n**Currently Offering: Fixed Rate Products**  \n| Product | LTV (Loan-to-Value) | 2-Year Fixed | 5-Year Fixed |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| **Residential Mortgage** | <60% LTV | **4.50%** | **5.00%** |\n| **Residential Mortgage** | 60–80% LTV | **4.75%** | **5.25%** |\n| **Residential Mortgage** | 80%+ LTV | **5.25%** | **5.75%** |  \n**Also Offering: Variable Rate (Tracker)**  \n| LTV Range | Variable Rate (BoE + Margin) |\n|---|---|\n| <60% LTV | BoE Base + 1.50% = **5.50%** |\n| 60–80% LTV | BoE Base + 1.75% = **5.75%** |\n| 80%+ LTV | BoE Base + 2.25% = **6.25%** |  \n**Early Repayment Penalty (Fixed Rate):**\n- Typically 1–3% of outstanding balance if early repayment during fixed period\n- No penalty if switching rate type  \n---",
